#. Description of the plugin
#: geolocation-plus-for-hivepress.php
msgid "Extends the HivePress Geolocation extension with free map providers, custom location attributes, tidier address display, restricted location suggestions, service areas for vendors who travel and a customisable map block."
msgstr ""

